    %%   two functions in queries.ts have no caller in webapp/app or
    %%   webapp/components. See ER_Diagram_Legacy.mmd.
    %% - RPC functions get_naturalness_distribution and
    %%   get_top_sites_distribution (queries.ts:940, 950).
    %% - Image and PDF files are in AWS S3, not in Supabase Storage.
